1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,700
The Great
Sphinx of Giza

2
00:00:01,700 --> 00:00:03,233
is not a woman.

3
00:00:03,233 --> 00:00:04,733
It has a lion's body

4
00:00:04,733 --> 00:00:06,300
and the face
of a king,

5
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:07,567
in the royal headcloth

6
00:00:07,567 --> 00:00:09,033
of a pharaoh.

7
00:00:09,033 --> 00:00:11,367
Hatshepsut, a
woman who ruled

8
00:00:11,367 --> 00:00:13,100
as pharaoh, appears as

9
00:00:13,100 --> 00:00:14,567
a sphinx too, with

10
00:00:14,567 --> 00:00:16,733
a king's
ceremonial beard.

11
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Full story on Quiet Origins
